=== Demo complete ===
Demonstrated: 3-validator consensus on the same ledger, a wallet
transfer reconciled on all 3 nodes, epoch issuance executing through
the monetary hook, and halt-and-resume after a validator stop.
All values TEST-ONLY. No deployment, no token issuance, no spending.
The network ran independently of the OGO application throughout.

